Z||000000||Smoooooth GT||11-07-2001||01:13 AM||||Is there a web site that I can check to see if my 86' has had the recall's done or not??<BR>I called the Pontiac dealership and they told me that they did'nt have anyway of knowing or checking.. Their voice changed when I told them it was a Fiero... Steve<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Smooooth_Yellow_sig_3.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smooth_sig_blue_3.gif"> ||||reg||1
