Z||000003||Smoooooth GT||11-07-2001||02:03 AM||||I checked that site.. and it does'nt say if recall's have been done or not...  I would I know or how can I find out if they have been done previously??  Steve||||reg||1
Z||000004||conductor||11-07-2001||05:33 AM||||If it has been done the there should be a sticker on the wheelwell in your frontcompartment, or near your (whats the name) coolingsystem. The decklidstrip must have been removed(unless youve got a new decklid)and they must have placed a few heatingshields.<BR>Those are a few things you can check out yourself.<BR>If you are not sure, mail to Pontiac, <A HREF="http://www.pontiac.com" TARGET=_blank>www.pontiac.com</A>  (?) write them that you live on top of a hill and youre not sure if you can rely on your car right now.<BR>It will take a week or so but they will help you further||||reg||7
Z||000005||Nashco||11-07-2001||08:36 AM||||Another thing to look for is the PCV system; this is the best/easiest thing to know for sure if it was done.  Your intake boot (from air cleaner to throttle body) should have a metal tube going into the backside of it that comes from your valve cover.  This is the PCV tube.  The old (pre-recall) PCV system had a hose going from the valve cover to a metal tube on the firewall.  The metal tube followed the firewall to the front (firewall) side of the air canister, and used another short rubber hose to attach to the air canister.  Your air canister should have a black plug covering that hole on the front of the canister.  Also check for the sticker and the engine deck lid seal along the front edge.  These are all easy to spot.<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
Z||000006||86seyellow||11-07-2001||09:00 AM||||MY recalls were never don. i fought for 5 months with ponitac and a dealer. they will not pay dealer for this. so u will have to fight and use the attorney general. i got $750 from pontiac for the recalla, i live in minnesta, state laws vary<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/86seyellow_new1.JPG"> <BR>All Stock plus goodies||||reg||1
